  {:id :RUN7 :class :RUN :status :done :reviewed-by "codex" :reviewed-at "2026-09-01T19:56:51Z" :covers-key :none :review "Read all four evidence diffs (039b0b8, ed2be78, b5da2bf, cf36ac1) and confirmed none touches aif-equations.edn or control-map-edges.edn. Re-ran 116 tests / 492 assertions across war-machine, trace, policy-precision, run-tick-once and wm-run-lock: 0 failures, 0 errors; clj-kondo 0 errors / 0 warnings; check-parens exit 0. The real pre-flight exited 0 after 25.6 s with 0 POSTs, 0 .admintoken reads and the run lock released. Independent arms script exited 0: 20/20 usable fields, solver-control delta 0.0, and all 20 recorded betas reproduced at delta 0.00e+00; beta_0=1.0 carried beta 1.002646073 -> 1.034342317, gamma 0.997360910 -> 0.966797920, with 20/20 converged and bracketed. Grep found policy-precision-state readers only at beta-dark-carry, trace persistence, and the arms reader; the pinned 183749a trace predates the field. pointer_check: 246 pointers / 0 unresolved; negative_controls: PASS (16 negative, 10 positive). The converged-and-bracketed carry rule is coherent with the subsequently recorded b2 fallback: unsolved ticks hold the carried variational beta and do not cross to the selection-gain law." :owner-did "2026-09-01, claude-20 (CLI work seat)" :unblocked-by "wm-build-loop: depends-on all :done" :depends-on [:RUN3 :RUN12 :RUN11]
